Package: libgarcon-1-0
Version: @DEB_GARCON_V@
Architecture: @DEB_ARCH@
Maintainer: @DEB_MAINTAINER@
Section: Libraries
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://docs.xfce.org/xfce/garcon/start
Depends: libglib2.0-0, libgtk-3-0, libxfce4util7, libxfce4ui-2-0
Description: freedesktop.org compliant menu implementation for Xfce
 garcon implements the freedesktop.org menu specification used to build the
 applications menu in the panel, appfinder and desktop. Ships libgarcon-1 and
 the libgarcon-gtk3 menu widgets plus the menu data files.
